  "prefLabel": "Acp 104.03 Inspection of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Acp 104.03 Inspection of Records. Persons desiring to inspect board records shall identify as specifically as possible the information being sought. If records are requested which contain both public and confidential information, the board shall delete the confidential information and provide the remaining information.\n\nSource. #7080, eff 8-26-99",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/acp100-700.html"
